: "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dapper-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schema, digest and linter checks establish structure and provenance, not whether source assertions support the prose. Final acceptance checks exact metrics, authorized locators and scientific scope; paragraph generation cannot introduce new research."}, {"id": "docs_dapper_integration_payload_snapshots", "label": "Immutable payload observations and provenance documents", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dapper-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One DAPPER digest may allow multiple verified payloads when unhashable fields change. Retain snapshots by object ID plus payload checksum and full provenance edges/documents; a node digest does not hash the whole graph."}, {"id": "docs_dapper_integration_gap_projection", "label": "Stable semantic gap projection", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dapper-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Map source gap content/kind/entity context to DAPPER while raw status, retrieval time and source refresh remain provenance observations. Status-only changes should not remint gaps; source scientific changes legitimately may."}, {"id": "docs_dapper_integration_locked_dapper_runtime", "label": "Locked DAPPER 0.2.0-a1 runtime", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/dapper-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Implemented bootstrap clones a reviewed locked release and runs a shared scientific-account linter. It explicitly accepts historical v8 inputs; remaining Box provision and trusted worker gates are not implemented."}], "edges": [{"source": "doc